&lt;li&gt;Provide online publisher partners with excellent and timely service/technological advice to implement advertising&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize, track, and analyze advertising performance and make suggestions to publishers to optimize performance&lt;/li&gt;
